# Process (vexbook, binding)

Follow [`docs/PROCESS.md`](docs/PROCESS.md) and every must-apply shared doc
listed there. Today that is:

- [`docs/rules/SDD-GATE.md`](docs/rules/SDD-GATE.md) — hard SDD permission gate.

Summary:

- Plan → Draft `specs/NNN-slug/{plan,spec,tasks}.md` → **STOP** for owner
  Accept/OK → implement (TDD) → PR linking the spec.
- Plan work stops at Drafts. Plan approval is not implement permission.
- One concern per spec; spec `000` is the product baseline.
- Board, tasks, and version (when `bump` is not `none`) land in the same PR.
- When product docs conflict with PROCESS, PROCESS wins (see
  `docs/adr/0001-adopt-vexbook-process.md`).
